("bdcg-milan-wage-earners-info", "WEWB membership benefits: scholarships for children, migrant quota for school admission, repatriation of workers in distress, airport ambulance, body transport cost, Tk 35,000 for transport and burial at the airport, Tk 3 lakh grant to the family after a death abroad", "প্রবাসে মৃত্যু হলে মৃত কর্মীর পরিবারকে ৩ (তিন) লক্ষ টাকা আর্থিক অনুদান।", "2026-07-02", V),
