("bdcg-milan-nulla-osta-info", "Papers for the body nulla osta: death certificate from the Italian hospital or comune, original passport and copy, name/phone/document of a Bangladeshi in Italy handling transport and of the receiver in Bangladesh, and WEWB membership copy if any", "১. মৃত্যুসনদ পত্র (ইতালিয়ান হাসপাতাল/ কমুনে কর্তৃক প্রদত্ত)", "2026-07-02", V),
